The problem is indeed that `dict` is not hashable and since we use that internally, we cannot hash our operator classes. One solutions would be the following:
```python
class SparseLabelOp:
    ...

    def __hash__(self) -> int:
        return hash(repr(self))
```
This would make all operators hashable (again) and enables the caching again
